{"bankId":"B-SRC-25-1690","section":"BAHAGIAN B","domain":"Matematik","repairType":"MATERIAL_REWRITE_CORE_DUPLICATE","reviewStatus":"EDITORIAL_REPAIRED_PENDING_QA","sourceDuplicateFamily":"B-CORE-DUP-0010","constructFamily":"flight_arrival_time_zone_backward","plannedLevel":3,"question":"Bandar B adalah 2 jam di belakang Bandar A. Sebuah penerbangan bertolak dari Bandar A pada 3:30 petang dan mengambil masa 4 jam. Berapakah waktu tempatan di Bandar B ketika tiba?","options":["3:30 petang","5:30 petang","7:30 petang","9:30 malam"],"answerIndex":1,"solutionSteps":["Waktu tiba mengikut Bandar A = 3:30 petang + 4 jam = 7:30 petang.","Bandar B 2 jam di belakang, jadi waktu tempatan = 5:30 petang."]}
